{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は1日オフだったので\n久しぶりに家族みんなで\nお出かけしました(｡>ω<｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そらまちの天空で\n富士の星暦というプラネタリウムをみてそれからすみだ水族館にいきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水族館の入り口入ったところ！\n後ろの液晶画面とぱぱのシャッター\nタイミングが合わず、\nふるさとへしか書いてない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンギンかわいかったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな泳いでるのに2羽だけでてきて\nカメラ目線とかしてくれたんだよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっぽ向いてるペンギンさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～こっちみてよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおおお！\nこっち見てくれた！\nカメラ目線♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～ぁ。\nあっち向いちゃった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、お台場にいって\nお台場のbillsでご飯たべたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんが撮ってくれたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれ、日奈子とお兄ちゃんのカメラタイミングがずれてるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、この顔自分で撮るとできない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、ジョイポリスに行こうと思ったんだけどやめて\n家に帰って夜遅くまで\n家族でドンジャラしたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかった～♪大きい得点の狙っても無理そうだったから\n小さい得点のいっぱい取って行こう作戦だったのに、ビリだったよ～( ºΔº )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと強くなってからまた、皆に挑戦しにいこ～っと٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、明日ブログ書きます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから。。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/14/2838569/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、あっしゅん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあっしゅんかわいい。\n全部可愛いんだけど、なんかいつもと\n違くてかわいい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？この写真もう載せたかな？\nわからないや。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい♪"}],"source":"archive"}